# Course-material corpus. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC — source documents and anything
# derived from them that carries their text must never be committed. Whitelist,
# not blacklist, so a new corpus file is ignored by default rather than by luck.
# gold-questions.json is exempt: the questions are ours, and it quotes no source text.
/resources/kb/*
!/resources/kb/gold-questions.json
